                                    <div class="o_colored_level col-lg-6 offset-lg-6 col-9 pb144">
                                        <h1 class="display-3">About Us</h1>
                                        <p>We’re a small architecture studio and we design private homes, from the first sketch to the day you move in.</p>
                                        <p><br/></p>
                                        <p>
                                            <a class="o_translate_inline btn btn-primary" href="#Who-we-are">More about us</a>
