                                    </div>
                                    <div class="o_colored_level pt24 col-lg-12">
                                        <p><span class="h6-fs"><strong>Archidukes is a small studio of architects, designers, and project managers. We only design houses. That focus lets us give each project the time it needs and understand what makes a home work, beyond how it looks.</strong></span></p>
                                    </div>
                                    <div class="o_colored_level pt24 col-lg-12">
                                        <p>Over the years, we’ve designed and built residences in coastal, rural, and mountain settings. They differ in size and style, but they share a few principles: good natural light, honest materials, and layouts that suit the people who live in them.</p>
                                    </div>
                                </div>
